ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nSun Yue is the person in charge of the school drama club, she plans an important campus theater performance. During the rehearsal, Li Ming uses the props casually without understanding their value and fragility, and does not know that he accidentally damages the props. Zhang Tao, another member of the drama club, knows about Li Ming's behavior, but because he always has opinions on Sun Yue, he decides not to tell her. When Sun Yue asks the drama club members about the damage to the props, Li Ming realizes his mistake.\n\n[Question]\nWhat is the possible intention of Zhang Tao's behavior?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Tao possibly chooses not to tell Sun Yue about the damage to the props because he worries that Li Ming will be blamed for this.\nB. Zhang Tao does not tell Sun Yue that the props are damaged because he is busy dealing with other more urgent drama club issues and does not notice this matter.\nC. Zhang Tao possibly chooses to remain silent out of a desire for revenge, hoping to cause trouble for Sun Yue.\nD. Zhang Tao possibly wants to attract Sun Yue's attention and deliberately creates trouble.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069964176920541,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e13bd6006945d27feab2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367803426,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7adc4bfc520a429283